\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {17}{\ignorespaces The network as trained, before any explanation, in full. Blue: positive weight (raises the score); red: negative weight (lowers it); thicker: larger weight. Orange outline and up arrow: raises the final prediction; teal and down arrow: lowers it; grey and double arrow: depends. Not used (no connection): sugar 120 or less, normal ECG, ST-T abnormal ECG, no exercise pain, exercise pain, downsloping ST, normal thallium, thallium code 4.\relax }}{21}{figure.caption.42}%
